    "threads": [
      {
        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on program charter, scope, and success criteria for the pilot.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's kick off the Community Outreach Program. I've created a draft charter in A1 to get us started. Please review today and share your thoughts on the scope and success criteria. We need to finalize this for T1.",
            "mentions": [
              58895,
              76651,
              99312,
              393987,
              523420
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 58895,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing. The charter looks like a strong start. On the target community segments, I suggest we add more specific language around 'vulnerable residents' to ensure we are inclusive, for example, mentioning those with mobility issues or facing social isolation. This will help us focus our efforts.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_plus_sign",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 76651,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good point. From an event perspective, it would also help to clarify if we're targeting families with young children versus older adults. The type of event and venue would be very different for each.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Let's keep it simple for the pilot. I propose we focus on two main groups: young families and isolated seniors. That feels manageable.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 393987,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "In A1, what do we mean by 'success'? The metrics section is a bit vague. How will we measure 'engagement'?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 523420,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "Maybe we can start by just counting the number of people who attend the events?",
            "mentions": [
              393987
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 99312,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Focusing on those two segments makes sense. We'll need very different communication strategies for each. For isolated seniors, traditional methods like flyers in community centers might work better than social media.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Okay, let's decide. We will target 'young families' and 'isolated seniors' for this pilot. I'm making that call so we can move forward.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 523420,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Decision noted. I'll update the project tracker.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "On success metrics, let's keep it simple and measurable. I propose our top three are: 1. Total number of attendees, 2. Number of new volunteers recruited, 3. Positive feedback score from a simple survey.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M11",
            "speaker_id": 393987,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "Ok, I can build a spreadsheet for that for T5.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M12",
            "speaker_id": 58895,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "Those are good output metrics. To show deeper impact, could we add a fourth, more qualitative one? Something like 'Number of residents connected to a new support service'. It would demonstrate the program's value beyond just attendance.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M13",
            "speaker_id": 76651,
            "reply_to": "M12",
            "text": "I like that. It connects to the 'why' of our work. We could track that at the information table during events.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M14",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M12",
            "text": "Four is too many to track for a pilot. Let's swap one. The feedback score can be subjective. I like the 'connected to service' idea. So, our top three are: 1. Attendees, 2. New volunteers, 3. Residents connected to services. Are we all agreed?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M15",
            "speaker_id": 58895,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Agreed. That's a strong set of metrics.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M16",
            "speaker_id": 99312,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Yes, this works. These are strong points for our external communications as well.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M17",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Great. Decision made. Those are our three success metrics.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D2"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "rocket",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M18",
            "speaker_id": 393987,
            "reply_to": "M17",
            "text": "I will update the M&E framework draft for T5 with these.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M17",
            "text": "Excellent. I'll get the final charter A1 approved by leadership by EOD. T1 is complete.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
