      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Lock in the design and logistics for the first outreach event.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 76651,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, I've put together a proposal for our first outreach event as part of T3. It's a 'Community Cafe' concept targeting isolated seniors. I've filled out the logistics checklist in A7 with two potential dates and locations. Please take a look and let me know your thoughts.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "Thanks. Option 1 (church hall) is cheaper. Let's go with that.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 99312,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Just a thought - Option 2 (the local library's meeting room) is on a main bus route. That could be a major factor for seniors with mobility challenges. It might be worth the extra £50 venue hire for better accessibility and potentially higher turnout.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 58895,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "That's a crucial point, @99312. Accessibility must be a priority. The library also has accessible toilets, which the church hall lacks. I'd strongly vote for Option 2.",
            "mentions": [
              99312
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_plus_sign",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 76651,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "Excellent points. I was leaning towards the library for that reason too. I can adjust the budget to accommodate it. So, are we agreed on the Library Meeting Room, next Tuesday at 10 AM?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "You've made a good case. Safety and accessibility are more important than the small cost difference. Let's lock in the library for next Tuesday at 10 AM.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 523420,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "Decision D5 noted. I'll add it to the main Community Events Calendar A6.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 76651,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "Great. Now for the run-of-show, detailed in A7. It's a simple 90-minute event: welcome, coffee/tea, a short talk from a local partner, and then informal chat. For staffing, I'll be there, and we'll need our 4 volunteers. I think we need one other staff member to help manage conversations and support volunteers.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 58895,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "I can be the second staff member. It would be a good opportunity for me to support the new volunteers and see our onboarding in action.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "raised_hands",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 393987,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Will someone be collecting the data?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 76651,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Yes, one of the volunteers at the welcome table will be responsible for the attendance sheet and handing out the feedback forms.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 41244,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Perfect. So the staffing is confirmed: @76651 and @58895 as staff leads, plus 4 volunteers. The run-of-show looks good. Let's approve it.",
            "mentions": [
